// infer gives `c ? i : (d ? 1e300 : 0.0)` the type i32 (right, the third being a "literal"), lit_check_fits cannot fold the inner ternary, and C computes a double and converts it. UBSan: float-cast-overflow.
main: proc() -> i32 = { c: b32 = 0; d: b32 = 1; i: i32 = 0; x: i32 = c ? i : (d ? 1e300 : 0.0); return x; }
